<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 89,000 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs actual Tuesday 89,000 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Tuesday's actual 89,000 head at interior Iowa and southern Minnesota. Opening trade was not well established. Early sales of barrows and gilts traded $0.50 to $1.00 higher compared with mid-session Tuesday. Top $58.00 per cwt.</p>
<p>			   Country		   Plants</p>
<p>US 1-3   46-49% Carcass Base Lean*</p>
<p>220-260 lbs	    55.00 -56.50	   56.00 -57.50</p>
<p>few				 57.00		    58.00</p>
<p>Sows - mostly steady/uup $1.00. Top $53.00.</p>
<p>US 1-3 300-450 lbs.  43.00 -45.00	   44.00 -46.00</p>
<p>450-500 lbs.	   44.00 -48.00	   44.00 -48.00</p>
<p>500 lbs. up	    48.00 -52.00	   48.00 -53.00</p>
